### User 1 (jantester) sends invite to User 2 (marekgarek)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/friends/invites
Authorization: Bearer {{token1}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "marekgarek"
}

### User 2 (marekgarek) checks invites
GET http://localhost:8080/api/friends/invites
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}

### User 1 (jantester) checks sent invites
GET http://localhost:8080/api/friends/invites/sent
Authorization: Bearer {{token1}}

### User 2 (marekgarek) accepts invite from User 1 (jantester)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/friends/invites/jantester/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}

### User 1 (jantester) checks friends
GET http://localhost:8080/api/friends
Authorization: Bearer {{token1}}

### User 2 (marekgarek) checks friends
GET http://localhost:8080/api/friends
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}

### User 1 (jantester) deletes User 2 (marekgarek) from friends
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/friends/marekgarek
Authorization: Bearer {{token1}}

### User 1 (jantester) blocks User 2 (marekgarek)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/friends/marekgarek/block
Authorization: Bearer {{token1}}

### User 2 (marekgarek) checks friendship status (should not see blocked)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/friends/jantester/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token2}}

### User 1 (jantester) unblocks User 2 (marekgarek)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/friends/marekgarek/block
Authorization: Bearer {{token1}}

### User 1 (jantester) searches for User 2 (marekgarek)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/friends/search?query=marek
Authorization: Bearer {{token1}}